      "name": "Gitea security advisory (AV26-845) - Update 1",
      "description": "Serial Number: AV26-845 Date: August 25, 2026 Updated: October 20, 2026 As of August 14, 2026, Gitea is affected by vulnerabilities in the following product: Gitea Prior to 1.27.1 Update 1 Open-source reporting indicates that CVE-2026-20896 is being exploited in the wild. On August 25, 2026, Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Security Agency (CISA) added CVE-2026-60004 to their Known Exploited Vulnerabilities (KEV) Database. Remote Code Execution via diffpatch Git Hook Installation Gitea 1.27.1 is released Gitea 1.27.2 is released CISA KEV: CVE-2026-60004",
